<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower on Friday in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 588.16, down 1.53.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 338 to 192.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.03.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,013,650, compared with 26,595,615 Thursday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
